Package: northgate-rmm-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NorthGate RMM maintainers
Depends: adduser, python3 (>= 3.11), python3 (<< 3.12), systemd
Description: private read-only NorthGate RMM control-plane services
 This source-built package is for network-isolated Debian 12 qualification only.
 Installation on a NorthGate VM requires separate exact-plan G2 authorization.
